"ac12ce10-646c-11ef-9f9d-08f3ab807ef9,1131,27-08-2024 00:00,Site Office,Delhi,SONBCC3,NULL,Project,IT,SAP HR module,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,27-08-2024 17:35,155,""Dear Sir,"															
															
"I Have been filling my LTC claim, But Error """" At least 1 day leave is must during journey period"""" is displaying, There fore I am not able to fill the claim. The Advance for the same had already been availed by me."															
															
My journey period was 27-07-2024 to 31-07-2024 but extended up to 03-08-2024 due to flight cancellation because of rise in temperature at leh and rescheduling of the flight by Indigo airlines.															
															
Casual leave are approved for the complete Stay period.															
															
First I mailed to HR department  and they have advised to forward the mail to this ID.															
															
"The casual leave of 27.07.2024 and 03.08.2024  both Saturday,  previously approved for forenoon which were deleted and approved for full day (absence hours 4 are automatically taken by the system) but leave is approved for full day.     "															
															
Screen shots of LTC claim error and Leave approved are attached.															
															
You are requested to kindly do the needful.															
															
Regards															
Neel Kamal Sharma															
SSE															
Emp. No. 8564															
