"cab7b073-65d0-11ef-9f9d-08f3ab807ef9,1265,29-08-2024 00:00,Site Office,Delhi,SONBCC3,NULL,Project,IT,ESS related query,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,29-08-2024 12:04,164,""This is regarding sanctioning/application of leaves through ESS:"															
"i) While applying RH for 19.08.2024, a prompt message to fill-in """"hour"""" details is being sent but with RH no field for hour detail is available. This prompt is now recurring with all types of leaves (including CL)."															
"ii) The sanctioning authority (Dy.) is receiving a prompt message stating """"Payroll passed"""", for the CL(s): 28.06.2024  to 01.07.2024."															
"Screenshots of the ESS portal for the above two issues have been attached."",2,Others,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,ESS Leave Issues.docx,NULL,""There is technical issue in the CL Leave request created for 28.06.2024-01.07.2024. When creating CL request for multiple days, please make sure to choose """"FULL D"""" option in the forenoon/afternoon/full day field."															
"Please contact HR department to delete this request and then create the request again. Please contact HR department at - helpdesk.hronm@dmrc.org , helpdesk.hrproj@dmrc.org"",NULL,NULL,956,956,NULL,1,0,15166,KARNICA JAISWAL,8800862839,546405,,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,15166,29-08-2024 12:04,29-08-2024 12:16,956,172.19.6.213,NULL,5,NULL,NULL,0,0,,,NULL,NULL,0,1"															
