"cec15ac8-69fb-11ef-9f9d-08f3ab807ef9,1696,03-09-2024 00:00,Site Office,Delhi,SOJANTAR1,NULL,Project,IT,ESS applications,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,03-09-2024 19:22,9,""Dear Sir, I Yogesh Kumar JE/ Civil Employee Number 2418 Posted Under CGM Track Jantar Mantar Office New Delhi.As per the latest Telecom Policy, Supervisors are eligible for reimbursement of INR 10,000 on purchase of Mobile Handset (See Clause No.3 (i) Page No. 5 of 6 of Telecom Policy). I purchased a Mobile Handset in the month of May-2024 of value INR 22047 and during the process of applying for reimbursement through ESS portal, it shows that only INR 6667.00 will be reimbursed. I have attached a screenshot with the mail."															
"Kindly resolve my issue. It's been 3 years but it is still accepting Rs 6667."",2,Software,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,please share a screen shot of the error.,NULL,NULL,980,980,NULL,1,0,2418,YOGESH KUMAR,8595934457,NULL,,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,2418,03-09-2024 19:22,04-09-2024 10:50,980,172.19.6.231,NULL,5,NULL,NULL,0,0,,,NULL,NULL,0,1"															
