"18cc2684-8b7f-11ef-b074-507c6f2b8348,4397,16-10-2024 00:00,Site Office,Patna,PTN,NULL,Project,IT,VPP,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,16-10-2024 10:55,195,""Dear, sir/madam "															
contract PC03 LOA-DMRC/20/III-743/2020 															
"There comes and error during creation of group in BOQ variation. Screen shot of same has been attached for reference. Please do needful as soon as possible to resolve the issue."",2,Others,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,WhatsApp Image 2024-10-15 at 5-31-02 PM.jpeg,NULL,""According to the business logic being applied, if any existing group contains more than 100CR amount items, the system will not allow the addition of new items to it and will not allow the transaction to proceed."															
"So, Nodal has to create a new group and add respective items since the Old group capacity of 100CR is full. In the current issue, Amity added the new group and aligned items in it as discussed with the DMRC team"",NULL,NULL,1031,1031,NULL,1,0,2498,RAVI KUMAR RANJAN,NULL,NULL,,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,2498,16-10-2024 10:55,17-10-2024 10:58,1031,182.74.205.42,NULL,5,NULL,0,0,1,,,NULL,NULL,0,1"															
