"b04db1c0-9e86-11ef-b074-507c6f2b8348,5484,09-11-2024 00:00,L3,L3B,NJFD L3B,NULL,O&M,IT,SAP MM,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,09-11-2024 16:07,157,""Dear Sir, It is requested to change the G/L account in “Contract no. DMRC/RSW/NJFD/139, Comprehensive cleaning of Rolling Stock (metro trains coaches) and House Keeping of Depot premises at Najafgarh (including Line-9/Grey line depot) Train Depot of DMRC Ltd.” for booking of Expenses related to Train cleaning. Details are- Purchase Document- 55003106, LOA/PO no.- DMRC/20/III-892/2022(In VPP). Old Train Cleaning G/L Account(Existing in SAP)- 620206. New Train Cleaning G/L Account(To be changed in SAP)- 621105. Expenses related to Depot Housekeeping(Depot HK in SAP) which were previously booked under “G/L Account-620206” will continue to be recorded under the existing “G/L Account 620206”. So, no need to change G/L Account in Depot HK in SAP. Change is needed only in Train Cleaning G/L account. Refer attachment please."",2,Others,1,NULL,11-11-2024 10:32,2544,RS new GL_merged(2).pdf,NULL,""G/L Account in SAP is not editable once saved. So, it is not possible to change the G/L account of existing PO."",NULL,NULL,984,984,NULL,1,0,18548,ALOK KUMAR TRIPATHI,NULL,130321,,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,18548,09-11-2024 16:07,11-11-2024 10:48,984,172.19.6.226,NULL,5,NULL,0,0,0,,,NULL,NULL,0,1"															
