"0c1bd807-d16c-11ef-a21e-0f1334c95651,8045,13-01-2025 00:00,,,0,NULL,O&M,IT,others,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,13-01-2025 10:35,283,""Dear [HR/IT Support team Representative],"															
															
"I am writing to request an update to my dependents on the ESS portal/aayysh medical app. My medical certificate lists my parents as dependents. I am currently working at MML3, Mumbai location."															
															
I have completed the offline paperwork formalities side of our mumbai Location HR  as per Annexure-D for updating/modifying my service records to include my family members. Could you please let me know if I can email the necessary documents for verification and addition?															
I have already emailed Vishakha ji and Rup Kumar ji at their respective email addresses:															
Vishakha ji: vishakhas.024@gmail.com															
Rup Kumar ji: (link unavailable)@gmail.com															
															
"Awaiting their response."""""															
															
"I would appreciate it if this matter could be resolved via email, if possible."															
															
ATTACHMENT :															
ANNEXURE - D															
UPDATED AADHAR CARD COPY OF FAMILY MEBERS.															
INCOME CERTIFICATE 															
MEDICAL CARD COPY															
															
Thank you for your 															
AMIT KUMAR MALVIYA															
20134/RS/O&amp;M/MML-3/DMRC															
