Please assist me in updating my E-Medical Card with the following:															
															
1. New Email ID: hbhatnagar2@gmail.com															
"2. New Residential Address: J-072, Gulshan Bellina, Ek Murti Chowk, GH-02A, Sector-16A, Greater Noida, Gautam Buddha Nagar, UP-201009."															
3. My spouse's profile picture is incorrectly displaying my image.															
															
"Additionally, I am facing issues updating my profile picture on the E-Medical Card due to the deactivation of my old ESS login."															
															
I would greatly appreciate your help in resolving these issues and updating my E-Medical Card details accordingly.															
