"12c6b066-f33c-11ef-a076-0afed946d145,10270,25-02-2025 00:00,,,SOMUM,NULL,Project,IT,Vendor Payment Portal,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,25-02-2025 11:09,194,""DMRC has executed the work of """"Polling booth arrangement work at KVM High School near the monopole location 37NEW for Maharashtra Legislative Assembly (Vidhan Sabha) election 2024"""" through the contractor M/s KM Infra."															
"The contractor has submitted the BOQ for approval in the VPP portal for the above mentioned work. The total base amount i.e. Rs.83,171.48 (Excl. GST) and gross amount i.e. Rs.98,142.34 (Incl. 18% GST), filled by the contractor is found ok as shown in the screenshot 1. However, the total amount is not matching with the amount shown in the GROUP 1 created by DMRC for approving the BOQ of the contract. The same is shown in screenshot 2. This issue will create discrepancy later on during the time of bill payment."															
"Assistance is required, in this regard, to proceed for the approval of BOQ submitted by the contractor in VPP portal."",2,Others,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,""Screenshot 1.jpg,Screenshot 2.JPG"",NULL,""Sir, Needful has been done. Please check."",NULL,NULL,1031,NULL,NULL,1,0,3555,DEEPESH KUMAR DEHARIA,9911654437,NULL,,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,3555,25-02-2025 11:09,25-02-2025 11:39,1031,14.141.31.187,NULL,5,NULL,0,0,0,Polling booth arrangement,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1"															
