"951a9ca5-fd72-11ef-a243-10153cebe7c2,10724,10-03-2025 00:00,L3,L3A,MDHS3,NULL,O&amp;M,IT,Intranet/Internet,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,10-03-2025 11:13,318,""Dear IT Team,"															
															
"It is to inform that for official work related to Metro Adventure Club Group of DMRC, we require to access various websites like google drive and gmail and takes help from the CHATGPT to create itenary for the trip. But none of the above websites are working in the system. "															
															
"In view of the above you are requested to kindly fix the issue at the earliest for the smooth operation of the official work."",2,Network,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,Reported to IT O&M Team. For more details please contact to CSS/Telecom with WMS ID No. 307501,3,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,1,0,16513,Somali dhoundiyal,9958391954,NULL,,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,16513,10-03-2025 11:13,10-03-2025 11:14,NULL,NULL,NULL,5,NULL,307501,0,0,NULL,10.27.4.40,NULL,NULL,0,1"															
