"482f20c4-0643-11f0-a243-10153cebe7c2,11212,21-03-2025 00:00,Site Office,Patna,PTN,NULL,Project,IT,ESS applications,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,21-03-2025 16:27,5,""This is to inform you that my appointment is under contractual basis (IDA scale) for five years ( 25.09.2020 to 25.09.2025) in DMRC. Accordingly all leaves credited in my ESS portal."															
"As per serial no.14 of DMRC offer letter, “For leave and other allowances, you will be governed by the rule in vogue time to time.”"															
" In view of above, when I apply on ESS portal, it appears on the screen that this facility is for regular employees. Undersigned wants to reimburse to the leave encashment."															
"Therefore, it is requested to activate the encashment facility on my ESS portal as per the DMRC offer letter so that, I may encash my Earned Leaves."",2,Software,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,Screenshot 2025-03-21 133701.png,NULL,""The re-employed /contract personnel working in DMRC are not eligible for encashment of leave. It is mentioned in """"Encashment of leave """" paragraph of HR Compendium of Service Rules. For further clarifications you may contact HR."															
															
Kindly contact HR department at:															
for O&amp;M - helpdesk.hronm@dmrc.org															
"for Project - helpdesk.hrproj@dmrc.org"",3,NULL,1023,NULL,NULL,1,0,4155,BISHWAJEET KUMAR SINGH,8826820698,NULL,,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,4155,21-03-2025 16:27,22-03-2025 10:39,1023,152.52.170.10,NULL,5,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1"															
