"5b2076e1-0ac0-11f0-a243-10153cebe7c2,11457,27-03-2025 00:00,Site Office,Delhi,SONBCC5,NULL,Project,IT,Network connectivity,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,27-03-2025 09:32,312,""I would like to bring to your attention the persistent network issues on the 5th floor of NBCC, which have been affecting employees for a considerable period."															
															
"The WiFi has not been functioning, forcing employees to rely on LAN connections. However, as most modern laptops do not have an RJ45 port, employees have had to procure RJ45-to-USB converters at their own expense. Despite this, the LAN connection remains unstable due to cable-related issues."															
															
"Furthermore, the IT personnel deployed here have been unable to resolve the problem, citing a lack of necessary spare parts. This ongoing issue is significantly impacting productivity, and we kindly request immediate action to restore a stable network connection."",2,Network,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,internet issue solve,3,NULL,963,963,NULL,1,0,15822,Vikash kumar,7827897275,547401,,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,15822,27-03-2025 09:32,07-05-2025 09:21,963,152.52.170.10,NULL,5,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1"															
