"8c2598a7-0fb8-11f0-a243-10153cebe7c2,11860,02-04-2025 00:00,L7,L7A,MKPRD,NULL,O&amp;M,Others,SAP Authorization,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,02-04-2025 17:19,255,""Subject: Request for Goods Receipt Authorization for E&amp;M Department."															
															
"Dear Sir,"															
"We are experiencing a delay in processing Goods Receipts (GR) for Purchase Requisitions (PR) raised by Line-7 of the E&amp;M Department. The current system restriction only allows GR authorization for Line-7, while PRs are raised for multiple lines within the E&amp;M Department."															
															
"To streamline the process and avoid delays, we kindly request that you grant GR authorization for all lines within the E&amp;M Department when a PR is raised by Line-7. This will enable us to process GRs efficiently and prepare bills in a timely manner."															
															
"So it is requested kindly SAP authorization under Goods Movement (MIGO) of """" Good Receipt (GR)"""" for all lines as 103 &amp; 105."															
															
Encl. GR restriction for L-8 against PO NO. 51003064															
															
With Regards															
Sanjeev Kumar															
JE/E&amp;M/Custody store															
LN07/MP02															
"Tracking ID : 1057"",2,Others,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,SAP_GR.pdf,NULL,issue fix confirm with user,3,NULL,1025,NULL,NULL,1,0,11575,SANJEEV KUMAR,8700004743,170228,,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,11575,02-04-2025 17:19,03-04-2025 12:15,1025,152.52.170.10,NULL,5,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1"															
