"05e7efcf-13cd-11f0-a243-10153cebe7c2,12189,07-04-2025 00:00,Metro Bhawan,Metro Bhawan OnM,MBB6,NULL,NULL,IT,Medical App- Aayush,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,07-04-2025 21:56,355,""Respected Sir,"															
	"I am Pushpa Yadav, w/o Late Sh. Kamakhya Yadav who was working in your esteemed organization with employee number 6666 and was posted as Section Engineer. I am writing this application to request the concerned authority to update the details of dependent member of the deceased employee on DMRC Ayush App."														
"Vide Office Order: DMRC/HR/Medical /2025 dated 13.01.2025, Family members of Deceased employee under DEFHS were directed to register to the Ayush Medical App. As per the directions given in the said office order, I registered on the Medical App with the employee code of my late husband, but it shows the error that “User and Dependent Details are incompleted unable to generate QR Code or Medical Card” whenever I try to download Medical card through the said App. Further, it is to inform you that I tried to upload Life Certificate for this financial year i.e. 2025-26 through the App and it showed the details of my late husband, I proceeded with it and have upload the Life Certicate via the App."															
	"Therefore, I request you to kindly update update the details of dependent member of the deceased employee on DMRC Ayush App so that I can avail Medical Facility and Kindly peruse the Life Certificate uploaded through the App. I will be highly obliged if helped."														
"           Yours Faithfully,"															
															
Pushpa Yadav															
W/o Late Sh. Kamakhya Yadav															
"Mob. No.: 8929629028"",2,Software,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,defhs app error.jpeg,NULL,""The authorization of updating any employee data in master data is with HR department. kindly contact to "															
"Sh. Kunal Kumar, Extn. No. 534274 email id: kr.kunal@dmrc.org (for Project wing, retired employee, spouse and family members of Deceased Employees under DEFHS)."",3,NULL,1027,NULL,NULL,1,0,6666,Late Sh. Kamakhya Yadav,9910770522,NULL,,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,6666,07-04-2025 21:56,15-04-2025 10:46,1027,152.52.170.10,NULL,5,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1"															
