"55fb5c2b-1a86-11f0-a243-10153cebe7c2,12571,16-04-2025 00:00,Site Office,Delhi,SOmp1,NULL,Project,IT,Vendor Payment Portal,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,16-04-2025 11:17,160,""Request regarding transfer of all Civil contracts from Nodal Executive Officer, Sh. Saleem Khan (Emp. no. 3072, JGM/Civil), to Sh. Rakesh Kumar Chaurasia (Emp. no. 1741, DGM/Civil), who has recently assumed the role of PM/4B in the CPM-4 office."															
															
