"In this regard , solve this issue as soon as possible"",2,Software,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,Screenshot 2025-04-29 083700.png,NULL,""The Laptop Reimbursement claim is still in status 'New' as it was saved as Draft. Please choose Edit Request option and then send the request by clicking on Next button. After the Laptop Reimbursement claim has been approved and status changes to 'Processing Complete' then you can create Laptop Repair/Maintenance request. Once the Laptop Reimbursement claim is processed, the asset data is maintained in the system which is required for Repair/maintenance claim."",3,NULL,956,956,NULL,1,0,4636,Prakash Deo Mishra,7054590001,534435,,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,4636,29-04-2025 16:30,30-04-2025 16:29,956,152.52.170.10,NULL,5,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1"															
