"Now when dates are selected for claim, the calender shows Current Month instead of the Month selected due to which have to select back month for each date claim which is very time consuming....."															
															
Also claims can't be applied for current month/Date.															
															
"It is requested to Integrate the selected Month with the calender opening for claims which will save very much time for the employee and hence for the organisation which can be utilised somewhere else."",2,Software,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,WhatsApp Image 2025-05-04 at 12-11-44.jpeg,NULL,""the calendar is attached with the system calendar which automatically fetch the current date and month further you can raise your suggestion in HR department, if they can find it feasible they can request for change in IT department."",3,NULL,1023,NULL,NULL,1,0,11873,RANBIR VASHISHT,9810807720,NULL,,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,11873,04-05-2025 12:15,05-05-2025 16:49,1023,152.52.170.10,NULL,5,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1"															
