"efe7e8c5-2a6f-11f0-a2af-111a524e8fe1,13738,06-05-2025 00:00,Site Office,Delhi,SOHBM1,NULL,Project,IT,Vendor Payment Portal,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,06-05-2025 17:17,195,""The contractor has submitted request for variation in BoQ. Item 8.3 of Schedule B8 is missing from the BoQ on VPP. However, from the total value of of contract, it seems that the amount of item 8.3 is included but the item itself is not visible. "															
"The contractor again submitted the request adding item 8.3 as extra item. This time, the total contract value increased by the amount of this item."															
"Further, item 1.2.2 of Schedule B4.1 is deduction item with rate (-)154.33/- However, the contractor has informed that negative rate or quantity is not being accepted on VPP."															
"There is also a mismatch in the total amount in the submission made by contractor and the amount visible on client's VPP."",2,Others,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,VPP ISSUES.pdf,NULL,""Item 8.3 of Schedule B8 -- is originally not a part of BOQ as verified by SAP PO 31002661, that's why vendor is adding this item in BOQ variation. 2nd point is -- SAP and VPP does not allow negative variation of any items in your BOQ."",3,NULL,1031,NULL,NULL,1,0,3781,VIPUL,8899054775,NULL,,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,3781,06-05-2025 17:17,09-05-2025 11:16,983,152.52.170.10,NULL,5,NULL,0,0,0,DMRC/20/IV-042/2020,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1"															
