"ed984f93-2c18-11f0-a2af-111a524e8fe1,13898,08-05-2025 00:00,Metro Bhawan,Metro Bhawan OnM,MBB5,NULL,O&amp;M,IT,Vendor Payment Portal,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,08-05-2025 20:00,279,""Initially, Invoice parking for the referred LOA i.e. DMRC/RMD/2024-25/W5/01/W.O was done in FY : 2025-26 (on 11/04/2025) by mistake (by sub subordinate staff). As it was a case of previous financial year i.e. FY 24-25 with invoice date and work completion falling in FY:24-25 only, hence it was learnt that posting was required on or before 31/03/2025. The same VPP file was returned by Finance nodal to executive nodal on 17/04/2025. After that on 08.05.2025, reversal of invoice parking was carried out by executive nodal which was successful. Date of Parked invoice was changed to 31.03.2025 and posting was attempted which yielded error. Re-posting also yielded error. VPP team may kindly see and resolve this issue. (Refer uploaded file)"",2,Software,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,ERROR_ SAP.pdf,NULL,""Dear Sir,"															
"As per issue, posting for previous financial year has been closed. please contact finance."",3,NULL,1031,NULL,NULL,1,0,7041,ARVINDRA KUMAR,9910376044,NULL,,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,7041,08-05-2025 20:00,09-05-2025 12:35,983,152.52.170.10,NULL,5,NULL,0,0,0,DMRC/RMD/2024-25/W5/01/W.O,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1"															
