"4906c59b-3474-11f0-a2af-111a524e8fe1,14337,19-05-2025 00:00,Site Office,Delhi,SH_ITPARK,NULL,Project,IT,ESS applications,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,19-05-2025 11:14,7,""Subject: Issue with EL Encashment Application (Reference No: 6993)"															
"I had applied for EL encashment for 60 days (Reference No: 6993). However, the latest approver is not visible in the system. Additionally, I am unable to reapply, as the system indicates that an EL encashment request for the current year is already in progress. I checked with the HR, and they have informed me that they have not received the request."															
															
"Kindly look into the matter and assist in resolving this issue at the earlies"",2,Software,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,""Screenshot (51).png,Screenshot (7).jpg,Screenshot (5).jpg,Screenshot (6).jpg"",NULL,""sir while applying the EL encashment ,instead of clicking the next button you have saved it to the draft that's why it is not processing. it will not be reapplied until you delete you request which is saved in draft. First click on leave encashment then on next page click on leave compensation then on next page select your request and delete it and after that you can reapply. while reapplying do not save it to draft and you request will be processed. I have uploaded the screenshots of the steps also"",3,NULL,1023,NULL,NULL,1,0,8987,MD. SOHAIL AKHTAR,9718542943,NULL,,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,8987,19-05-2025 11:14,20-05-2025 12:31,1023,152.52.170.10,NULL,5,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1"															
"8e3981bd-3474-11f0-a2af-111a524e8fe1,14338,19-05-2025 00:00,Site Office,Delhi,SH_ITPARK,NULL,Project,IT,ESS applications,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,19-05-2025 11:16,7,""Subject: Issue with EL Encashment Application (Reference No: 6993)"															
"I had applied for EL encashment for 60 days (Reference No: 6993). However, the latest approver is not visible in the system. Additionally, I am unable to reapply, as the system indicates that an EL encashment request for the current year is already in progress. I checked with the HR, and they have informed me that they have not received the request."															
															
"Kindly look into the matter and assist in resolving this issue at the earlies"",2,Software,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,Screenshot (52).png,NULL,""sir while applying the EL encashment ,instead of clicking the next button you have saved it to the draft that's why it is not processing. it will not be reapplied until you delete you request which is saved in draft. First click on leave encashment then on next page click on leave compensation then on next page select your request and delete it and after that you can reapply. while reapplying do not save it to draft and you request will be processed."",3,NULL,1023,NULL,NULL,1,0,8987,MD. SOHAIL AKHTAR,9718542943,NULL,,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,8987,19-05-2025 11:16,20-05-2025 12:24,1023,152.52.170.10,NULL,5,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1"															
