"It is to inform, that Sh. Rajeev Verma has been transferred to the CPM-2 office (Inderlok). Consequently, it is essential for the smooth functioning of the contracts pertaining to the CPM-4 office that they be managed by Sh. Kiran Singh going forward."															
"Additionally, it is to mention that all subordinate and Co-subordinate staff under Sh. Kiran Singh will remain unchanged."															
"It is kindly request the IT department to facilitate this transfer at your earliest convenience. For your reference, copy of the Handing Over-Taking Over charge attached herewith."															
The contract detail to be transfer from Emp. no. 322 to Emp. no. 597 are mentioned below:															
1	"LOA/PO no. DC-27, 31001204, (M/s Himcon Engineers India Pvt. Ltd.)"														
2	"LOA/PO no. DC-11, 31002673, (M/s Lisha Engineers Private Limited)"",2,Others,1,NULL,26-05-2025 12:45,41,Handing over & Taking over.pdf,NULL,""Dear Sir,"														
