"It is to inform, that Sh. Rajeev Verma has been transferred to the CPM-2 office (Inderlok). Consequently, it is essential for the smooth functioning of the contracts pertaining to the CPM-4 office that they be managed by Sh. Rakesh kumar Chaurasia going forward."															
"Additionally, it is to mention that all subordinate and Co-subordinate staff under Sh. Rakesh kumar Chaurasia will remain unchanged."															
"It is kindly request the IT department to facilitate this transfer at your earliest convenience. For your reference, copy of the Handing Over-Taking Over charge attached herewith."															
The contract detail to be transfer from Emp. no. 322 to Emp. no. 1741 are mentioned below:															
"1.LOA No: CPM4/PHASE-IV/LIMITED TENDER/ Road &amp; Associated Work/04, 32002942, (M/s Creative Construction)."															
"2.LOA No: CPM4/PHASE-IV/LIMITED TENDER/MISC./CIVIL/03, 32002914, (M/s Nirman Construction)"															
"3.LOA No: CPM4/C/02, 32002838, (M/s Nirman Construction)"",2,Others,1,NULL,02-06-2025 10:06,15,Handing over & Taking over.pdf,NULL,""Dear Sir,"															
