"c7c2a0c1-44f1-11f0-a2af-111a524e8fe1,15528,09-06-2025 00:00,L7,L7B,VNNRD,NULL,NULL,IT,Network connectivity,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,09-06-2025 10:52,357,""Dear Sir, "															
															
"In reference to our previous communication, we are pleased to attach the revalidation audit report for the L-7 ARMSS application. The report includes a comprehensive review and assessment of the application's compliance and performance. All the critical and highly sensitive points have been addressed and closed now. "															
															
"We kindly request the DMRC IT team to thoroughly review the VAPT report, which provides detailed insights into the application's accessibility features."															
															
"Based on the review of the report, we request that the domain name (preferred domain name- http://armss.dmrc.org:8080) for the L-7 ARMSS application be issued, considering the minor open points noted in the report. These points have been duly addressed and are not expected to impact the overall functionality and security of the application."															
															
Password of the report is same as shared previously.															
															
We appreciate your prompt attention to this matter and look forward to your feedback.															
															
 															
Thank you.															
"Best Regards"",2,Network,1,NULL,10-06-2025 16:52,1799,DMRC ARMSS Revalidation audit.pdf,33,""Domain and IP mapped , portal accessible over http only. Advise to configure system to listen on https instead of http."",3,NULL,997,997,NULL,1,0,5887,Sushil Kumar,8130477088,170734,,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,5887,09-06-2025 10:52,10-06-2025 16:55,997,152.52.170.10,NULL,5,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1"															
