This is regarding the updation required in the BG date of M/s KBS Certification Services Ltd. (User ID: 230426 and Vendor Code: 110516).															
															
"Earlier, the BG was valid till 09.12.2024, however, the work was further extended by competent authority upto 31st May'25."															
															
"Since, the BG has been submitted in the form of Demand Draft (DD) and as per LoA - Annexure-B, Clause No. 11, """"The Performance Security shall be valid upto 6 months beyond the date of completion of work"""", hence it is requested to extend the BG date till 30.11.2025 (Date of Completion of work + 6 months)."															
															
Details in which the above change is to be done is mentioned below:															
															
1. Name of work:   Verification of DMRC’s PoA PC-9863 (CPA-001)															
2. LoA No:  DMRC/Env/PC-9863/383A/2024/8020 dated 07.02.2024															
															
"It is requested to update the BG details on the VPP at the earliest so that the agency can initiate final RA bill."",2,Others,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,""Dear Sir,"															
"BG Date has been extended. please check it."",3,NULL,1031,NULL,NULL,1,0,14195,Ankit Sethi,9560772234,520619,,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,14195,11-06-2025 14:26,11-06-2025 14:39,983,152.52.170.10,NULL,5,NULL,0,0,0,DMRC/Env/PC-9863/383A/2024/8020 dated 07.02.2024,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1"															
