"65d25078-5ca1-11f0-b513-507c6f2b8348,17759,09-07-2025 00:00,Site Office,Delhi,SOMVP1,NULL,Project,IT,IT/OT Server/Application onboarding,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,09-07-2025 14:17,418,""Hello,"															
															
This email message was sent in response to a [IWE] request.															
															
"Your domain [dmrc.org] was not purchased from Microsoft. Due to this, you will need to add the information below on your hosting provider [eNom,LLC] website."															
															
"Please place a DNS TXT record on your domain. The TXT must include the following code to be considered valid, today’s date in the format: [07.07.2025]."															
															
Example: 															
    TXT Name: @															
    TXT Value: &lt;07.07.2025&gt;															
    TTL: 3600 (or your provider default)															
															
Adding this record won't affect your existing email or other services and you can safely remove it once the ticket has been resolved.															
															
Specific instructions regarding how to do this will only be available from your hosting provider since these changes are from one provider to another. Once you have added the record you can confirm it inside this website.															
															
Please note that the time frame to complete this action is three business days starting today.  															
															
"When you have completed adding the TXT record, please """"reply-all"""" to this email and let us know, so we may verify it has propagated or answer any outstanding questions if you have any. "															
															
"Thanks again,"															
Sachin															
Microsoft customer service and support															
															
"Your service request number is [2507010040002208] in case you need it."",2,Hardware,1,NULL,10-07-2025 11:38,1280,NULL,NULL,Requested DNS TXT Record has been added and intimated to Admin.,3,NULL,957,957,NULL,1,0,854,Amit Ranjan,7827935839,NULL,amit@dmrc.org,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,854,09-07-2025 14:17,10-07-2025 11:42,957,152.52.170.10,NULL,5,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1"															
