"792fb789-6c3b-11f0-b513-507c6f2b8348,19338,29-07-2025 00:00,L1,L1A,WC1,NULL,NULL,IT,Vendor Payment Portal,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,29-07-2025 10:48,153,""Subject: Re-Creation of Water Supply Bill – June 2025"															
															
"The water supply bill for the month of June 2025 was uploaded by the vendor (M/s. Shri Sai aqua logistics) and subsequently verified by the sub-subordinate staff of the Water Cell. Following verification, the bill was forwarded to the Finance Department for payment."															
"However, unfortunately the bill was returned to the executive nodal of operation department by the Finance Department without processing the payment."															
"Now, the VPP (Vendor Payment Portal) reflects the quantity of water bottles consumed along with the payment for June 2025, although the actual payment was not made."															
															
"In view of the above, you are kindly requested to recreate the water supply bill for the month of June 2025 for further processing with the line-wise same quantity of water bottles."",2,Others,1,NULL,29-07-2025 10:53,4,""VPP pic.jpeg,VPP.pdf"",NULL,""Dear Sir,"															
"As per discussed with you, you informed that the problem has been resolved."",3,NULL,1031,NULL,NULL,1,0,9438,Shailendra Kumar,9717444968,NULL,113487,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,9438,29-07-2025 10:48,29-07-2025 11:31,983,152.52.170.10,NULL,5,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1"															
