Vendor is not able to make the BOQ Variation (-ve) changes at VPP portal. 															
"Previously, the total tender cost was INR 21,836,557.60. After receiving the amended Purchase Order, the price has been revised to INR 21,801,822.24."															
															
"As per the terms and conditions of the RFP, the payment milestones are as follows:"															
KD1: 15% of total BOQ															
KD2: 50% of total BOQ															
KD4: 35% of total BOQ															
"The KD1 payment was already processed based on the previous BOQ amount, which now differs from the revised total due to the amendment. If Vendor update KD-2 &amp; 4 payment, then total BOQ differ due to KD-1 payment because vendor cannot change the processed payment."",2,Others,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,""Sir,  as per terms and condition of SAP, BOQ variation cannot be less than already delivered quantity- please consult with your finance department. Thanks"",3,NULL,1031,NULL,NULL,1,0,13598,Kuldeep Kumar,9650062529,NULL,,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,13598,29-07-2025 13:05,29-07-2025 14:23,983,152.52.170.10,NULL,5,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1"															
