"47e0c326-741a-11f0-b513-507c6f2b8348,20169,08-08-2025 00:00,Site Office,Delhi,SONBCC3,NULL,Project,IT,Old asset issued,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,08-08-2025 11:11,242,""I was posted in Mundka depot from 2010 to June-2020. Some IT equipments were issued to me for using in my section Technical cell of depot. I got promoted as AM/Electrical in June-2020 and transferred to project RS. I have handed over all items in depot and handing over note was signed for same countersigned by Dy.HOD of the depot. But still four items (One printer Make HP Designjet 500PS Plotter Model-C7770B S/N-MY730S306S, One UPS S/N-10AUPNB536009, and two nos. hard Disks) are showing on my name. Please remove these items from my name."",2,Hardware,1,NULL,06-09-2025 16:38,42086,NULL,NULL,""you need to get the same updated in O&amp;M/IT department. thereafter please update me at Project/IT department on call or the portal itself, so that i too update in my records."															
