"The Green building certification and Re-Certifaction works of DMRC Metro stations and other buildings is being dealt by the office of Sr.GM/E/Planning. As on date, Green Building Certification of upcoming stations &amp; RSS of Phase-IV and Recertification of existing stations, RSS, Depots, Staff quarters is under progress."															
The relevant data for Certification of a building need to be submitted to IGBC in soft copy (Documentation like Photograph &amp; PDF &amp; Excel) which is collected by office of Sr.GM/E/Planning from various DMRC departments for compliation and submission to IGBC.															
