"6ca5e7e6-9449-11f0-b513-507c6f2b8348,22239,18-09-2025 00:00,Metro Bhawan,Metro Bhawan OnM,MBB5,NULL,O&amp;M,IT,Network Or Internet Issues,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,18-09-2025 10:09,400,""RTD Servers at Vinod nagar, Mukundpur and Kalindi Kunj depot are unable to push data to Addtrack servers (10.100.4.201). PLease check."",2,Network,1,NULL,24-09-2025 10:53,8683,WhatsApp Image 2025-09-18 at 2-36-13 PM.jpeg,NULL,""During troubleshooting it was found that:"															
															
1. RTD server at KKD is assigned a public IP address (8.254.1.4). Another interface had APIPA IP address. NO interface was configured with Local subnet IP. 															
         Telecom staff to configure the local IP address available in the subnet.															
2. RTD server at VND are not in operation due to reasons best known to RS Team.															
3. RTD server at MKD were up and running. Running traceroute to Addtrack server at Metro Bhawan shows that packets are not passing through the L3 deployed in the local network at Mukundpur Depot. Telecom staff to check the issue at their end and get back.															
															
"Closing the ticket for now."",3,NULL,957,957,NULL,1,0,9748,Rishi Kumar Saraswat,9911780746,NULL,,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,9748,18-09-2025 10:09,24-09-2025 11:12,957,152.52.168.245,NULL,5,NULL,390199,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1"															
