"2fda3281-fc36-11f0-a02d-0afaca04b57f,35037,28-01-2026 00:00,,,SONBCC5,NULL,Project,IT,Vendor Payment Portal -VPP,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,28-01-2026 16:07,197,""Respected Sir,"															
															
"The payment for JPY Currency for Bill Code – 26000232 , 26000233, &amp; 26000235 of DS04 Contract was processed in VPP and DMRC/Finance/Dept. has highlighted the following issue with respect to value on VPP Portal after parking of the invoices :-"															
															
"1. The SES amount &amp; Parked Invoice amount for payment in JPY/YEN currency is showing different values on VPP Portal (Photos of VPP portal is attached for reference), however, the values are correct as being checked in SAP System."															
															
"2. Due to the above issue of VPP system, DMRC/Finance/Dept. has withheld the processing of payment for DS04 Contract. Therefore, it is kindly requested to rectify the VPP Portal issue at the earliest."															
															
"3. This problem persists every time we park an Invoice on VPP Portal pertaining to DS04 Contract and had already been raised vide e-mails dated 03.02.2025, 21.02.2025, 27.03.2025 and 01.10.2025 (Copy of e-mail(s) are attached for reference)."															
															
It has been informed several times on the VPP-Support mail id but till date there has been no permanent rectification regarding this discrepancy. Kindly provide the permanent solution regarding this issue.															
															
"Your prompt response in this regard will be highly appreciated."",2,Others,1,NULL,29-01-2026 14:20,1332,""DS04 Bill Code- 26000232.jpg,DS04 Bill Code- 26000233.jpg,DS04 Bill Code- 26000235.jpg"",NULL,""Dear Sir,"															
