"bd8e47ab-05a0-11f1-a323-507c6f2b8348,35619,09-02-2026 00:00,Site Office,Mumbai,SOMUMPOWAI,NULL,Project,IT,Vendor Payment Portal -VPP,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,09-02-2026 15:48,194,""For LOA No. 10383, the BOQ was initially created on VPP; however, due to the inadvertent entry of an incorrect GL code and Tax code, a BOQ variation had to be carried out. The variation was done with the same quantities, rates, and overall LOA amount."															
"Subsequently, while uploading the invoices, it was observed that the GST amount was varying from the BOQ values, particularly in respect of the service charges (including GST)."															
"In view of the above, it is requested to kindly delete the previously created BOQ so that a revised and rectified BOQ with correct GL code, Tax code, and GST details may be uploaded."",2,Others,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,""LOA EVEREST ENTERPRISES.pdf,BOQ for VPP.xlsx,Screenshot 2026-02-09 150401.png"",NULL,,3,NULL,1031,NULL,NULL,1,0,4043,JITENDRA PAL,7409716383,NULL,,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,4043,09-02-2026 15:48,09-02-2026 16:19,983,10.10.28.1,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,,Duplicate Entry ITS S/N-35620.,0,1"															
