"Subsequently, while uploading the invoices, it was observed that the GST amount was varying from the BOQ values, particularly in respect of the service charges (including GST)."															
															
"In view of the above, it is requested to kindly delete the previously created BOQ so that a revised and rectified BOQ with correct GL code, Tax code, and GST details may be uploaded."",2,Others,1,NULL,09-02-2026 17:12,79,""LOA EVEREST ENTERPRISES(2).pdf,BOQ for VPP(2).xlsx"",NULL,,3,NULL,1031,NULL,NULL,1,0,4043,JITENDRA PAL,74097163863,NULL,jitendra.4043@dmrc.org,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,4043,09-02-2026 15:52,09-02-2026 17:20,983,10.10.28.1,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,,""Dear Sir,"															
