"87c0e200-1946-11f1-9bc9-fcc3db027440,36781,06-03-2026 00:00,AEL,AEL,NDRU,NULL,O&amp;M,IT,Vendor Payment Portal -VPP,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,06-03-2026 15:53,192,""Subject: Issue in VPP Portal – Vendor Unable to Complete Registration for Bill Submission"															
															
"Dear Sir,"															
															
"E&amp;M Department has a vendor, M/s Bell Cooling Tower, who has completed the work at Depot-1, RMGL vide LOA No. DMRC/O&amp;M/E&amp;M/RMGL/2025/Cooling Tower/08 dated 03.12.2025."															
															
"After completion of the work, the vendor has submitted his bill for payment. However, he has registered himself on the VPP Portal, but is unable to complete his details due to a server error that occurs every time during the process."															
															
"In view of the above, you are kindly requested to resolve the server error at the earliest so that the vendor can complete the registration process and we may proceed with the payment before the financial year ending."															
															
"The details of the LOA and the error screenshot are attached for your reference."",2,Others,1,NULL,06-03-2026 16:06,12,""WhatsApp Image 2026-02-24 at 14-39-02.jpeg,8-LOA Ms Bell cooling tower RMGL.pdf"",NULL,,3,NULL,1031,NULL,NULL,1,0,21863,SURENDRA KUMAR SAINI,8963034515,NULL,,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,21863,06-03-2026 15:53,06-03-2026 16:22,983,10.10.28.1,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,,Duplicate entry ITS S/N-36784.,0,1"															
