"d16e30b8-1946-11f1-9bc9-fcc3db027440,36783,06-03-2026 00:00,Site Office,Delhi,SODKD1,NULL,Project,IT,Eoffice,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,06-03-2026 15:55,145,""Updation of designation in E-office"															
Nitin Rajput															
3:20 PM															
eofficehelpline helpline															
															
"Dear Sir/Madam,"															
															
It is submitted that the undersigned has been promoted to the post of Deputy General Manager (DGM) vide office order no. PT/4253/2026 dated 13.02.2026 and posted in the office of CPM-5 as Project Manager-5B vide office order dated 26.02.2026. The copy of the orders is hereby attached for reference. The Emp Id of CPM-5 i.e. Mr. Sanjiv Kumar is 4586.															
															
"In view of the above, it is requested that the designation of the undersigned may kindly be updated/changed to DGM(Civil) / PM-5B in the E-Office system at the earliest for the smooth functioning of official work."															
															
This is for your kind information and necessary action please.															
															
															
Regards															
