"b3af0558-1c30-11f1-9bc9-fcc3db027440,36875,10-03-2026 00:00,L1,L1A,SHPK,NULL,O&amp;M,IT,ESS applications,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,10-03-2026 08:54,8,As per ESS my rest day i9s on Monday. While applying for EL w.e.f. 19.03.2026 to 25.03.2026 total 07 days absence are shown as 40 hrs instead of 56 hrs.,2,Software,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,ess issue.jpg,NULL,,3,NULL,1023,NULL,NULL,1,0,6975,HARI MOHAN GARG,9911535418,110420,,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,6975,10-03-2026 08:54,10-03-2026 10:57,1023,10.10.28.1,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,,""The number of absence hours and the number of leaves deducted are two different things."															
"You applied for 7 days of Earned Leave (EL), so 7 leave days will be deducted. However, the absence hours are showing as 40 instead of 56 because one of the days is your weekly rest day and another day is the Eid holiday. Since absence hours are not counted on rest days and holidays, those two days are excluded from the hour calculation."															
"Therefore, the system correctly shows 40 absence hours while deducting 7 days of leave."",0,1"															
