"Also the OTP counter doesn't updates. I tried to resend OTP two times, but the counter still shows 0/5."",2,Software,1,NULL,12-03-2026 09:59,1,Screenshot_2026-03-12-09-45-23-190_org-dmrc-essapp-beta.jpg,NULL,,3,NULL,1054,1054,NULL,1,0,4347,Amit Kumar,8595947296,NULL,amit.4347@dmrc.org,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,4347,12-03-2026 09:57,12-03-2026 20:27,1054,152.57.238.155,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,,""Now the OTP are receiving. this update is not related to the OTP counter. It specifically refers to the Wrong Attempts Counter."															
