"24325066-2067-11f1-9bc9-fcc3db027440,37097,15-03-2026 00:00,L7,L7B,KKDA7,NULL,O&amp;M,IT,Email,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,15-03-2026 17:34,201,""I don't have my official mail ID and its password, kindly send me to my gmail id so that i can use that official mail id for my official work."",2,Others,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,,3,NULL,1018,NULL,NULL,1,0,20924,AMIT SINGH RAWAT,9716065643,NULL,,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,20924,15-03-2026 17:34,16-03-2026 09:39,1018,10.10.28.1,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,,""1. Open the URL: mail.gov.in 2. Log in using the following credentials: - Email ID: amit.20924@dmrc.org - Password: fffH3u?h 3. If you forget the password, click on """"Forgot Password."""" 4. Enter the Captcha displayed on the screen. 5. Click """"Continue"""" to reset the password. 6. Log in using your mobile number. 7. Create a new password. 8. Enter the new password and confirm it by re-entering the same password."",0,1"															
"e4bc8619-2067-11f1-9bc9-fcc3db027440,37098,15-03-2026 00:00,L7,L7B,KKDA7,NULL,O&amp;M,IT,Email,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,15-03-2026 17:40,130,As per previous query 37097 i didn't mentioned the mail id in which i get he official mail id. So kindly send me the details of my official mail id with password to my Gmail ID ie (amitrwt20@gmail.com).,2,Others,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,,3,NULL,1018,NULL,NULL,1,0,20924,AMIT SINGH RAWAT,9716065643,NULL,,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,20924,15-03-2026 17:40,16-03-2026 09:39,1018,10.10.28.1,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,,""1. Open the URL: mail.gov.in"															
2. Log in using the following credentials:															
   - Email ID: amit.20924@dmrc.org															
   - Password: fffH3u?h															
"3. If you forget the password, click on """"Forgot Password."""""															
4. Enter the Captcha displayed on the screen.															
"5. Click """"Continue"""" to reset the password."															
6. Log in using your mobile number.															
