"ec2972ad-28b5-11f1-9bc9-fcc3db027440,37559,26-03-2026 00:00,L7,L7B,SVVR,NULL,NULL,IT,Email,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,26-03-2026 07:11,138,""Respected Sir,"															
"I am Pradeep Kumar, Employee No. 9821, currently posted as Chief SC at Bhajanpura Metro Station (Line-7)."															
"I am writing to request assistance with resetting the password for my official email ID: pradeep.sc@dmrc.org. Currently, I am unable to reset the password because the mobile number registered with the account is no longer in my possession; due to a long period of inactivity, the telecom provider has reassigned that number to another person."															
"To facilitate the password reset and receive the necessary OTP, I request you to kindly update my contact details in the system to one of the following:"															
New Mobile Number: 8826974846															
															
Alternative Email ID: pradeepsagar1987@gmail.com															
															
"I would be grateful if you could look into this matter and resolve the issue at your earliest convenience, as I need access to my official mail for my duties."															
Thank you for your time and assistance.															
"Yours faithfully,"															
Pradeep Kumar															
"Chief SC, Bhajanpura Metro Station (Line-7)"															
Emp. No: 9821															
"Contact: 8826974846"",2,Others,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,I Card  Pradeep Kumar.pdf,NULL,,3,NULL,1018,NULL,NULL,1,0,9821,PRADEEP KUMAR,8826974846,NULL,pradeep.sc@dmrc.org,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,9821,26-03-2026 07:11,27-03-2026 10:18,1018,10.10.28.1,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,,""1. Open the URL: mail.gov.in"															
