"3. If you forget the password, click on """"Forgot Password."""""															
4. Enter the Captcha displayed on the screen.															
"5. Click """"Continue"""" to reset the password."															
6. Log in using your mobile number.															
7. Create a new password.															
"8. Enter the new password and confirm it by re-entering the same password."",0,1"															
