"1d226fb2-2e87-11f1-9bc9-fcc3db027440,37804,02-04-2026 00:00,Site Office,Delhi,SOHBM1,NULL,Project,IT,Vendor Payment Portal -VPP,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,02-04-2026 16:52,160,""Dear Sir,"															
															
"While submitting the bill on the VPP portal, we are encountering an error stating: “Please add maximum 300 line items for the Bill.”"															
															
"Previously, we were able to submit bills with 380–450 line items without any issue. If this restriction has recently been implemented in the VPP portal, the same was not communicated to us in advance."															
															
"At present, we have already raised the tax invoice for the bill, and due to this limitation, we are unable to proceed with the submission."															
															
We kindly request you to suggest the appropriate course of action in this matter so that we can complete the submission at the earliest.															
															
