"9dbad80a-3401-11f1-9bc9-fcc3db027440,38044,09-04-2026 00:00,Site Office,Delhi,SODKD1,NULL,Project,IT,Vendor Payment Portal -VPP,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,09-04-2026 16:11,193,""Sh. Shivam Singh, Sr.DGM/Civil, Emp. No.-1328 has been transferred from MMI unit and Sh. Pramod Kumar, DGM/Civil, Emp No.-1247 has been posted in MMI unit under CPM-5. "															
															
"Following contracts are required to be forwarded to Sh. Pramod Kumar, DGM/Civil, Emp No.-1247: "															
"1. Hiring of Consultant for Proof checking of structural Drawings of E-bus feeder depots at Dwarka, Nangloi &amp; Mundka Metro Stations viz. Contract OCW-1437, OCW-1413 &amp; OCW-1421."															
2. Hiring of Consultant for Proof checking of structural Drawings for terminals of DTC at Azadpur &amp; Najafgarh viz. Contracts OCW-1363 &amp; DTC/NJF-01R.															
															
Handing/taking over notes and LOA are attached.															
															
"It is requested that above two contracts may please be forwarded to Sh. Pramod Kumar, DGM/Civil, Emp No.-1247."															
															
"Submitted for necessary action please."",2,Others,1,NULL,10-04-2026 10:46,1114,ilovepdf_merged (4)_compressed.pdf,NULL,,3,NULL,1031,NULL,NULL,1,0,18920,SADHU SHARAN YADAV,9473370344,NULL,,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,18920,09-04-2026 16:11,10-04-2026 11:07,983,10.10.28.1,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,,""Sir, LOA No. DMRC/GM/LMC/QUOTATION/BUS TERMINAL/2024-25/4 and DMRC/GM/LMC/QUOTATION/E-BUS DEPOT/Q-3/2023/LOA/12, have been successfully transferred."",0,1"															
