"664754cd-3c88-11f1-9bc9-fcc3db027440,38335,20-04-2026 00:00,L5,L5,MAPR,NULL,NULL,IT,ESS applications,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,20-04-2026 12:36,5,""In personal profile section of ESS, No data available is showing in Education sub section. I have done MBA in Finance and (P &amp; OM) and the same is showing in HR portal as well (confirmed by HR department). HR department has suggested to lodge this matter in IT portal, so you are requested to do the needful and resolve the matter at the earliest. Screenshot is attached for your ready reference."",2,Software,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,Amit Kumar 22373.png,NULL,,3,NULL,1023,NULL,NULL,1,0,22373,AMIT KUMAR,9718349344,653630,NULL,AMIT.22373@DMRC.ORG,1,NULL,NULL,22373,20-04-2026 12:36,16-05-2026 10:53,1023,10.10.28.1,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,,""As confirmed by the HR Department, your qualification details — MBA in Finance and P&amp;OM — are already available in the HR records/SAP system."															
															
"The issue was examined from all possible aspects and necessary efforts were made to resolve it. However, it has been observed that making changes in the current configuration may affect the data of other employees as well. Therefore, the required modification is presently not feasible from the system end."															
