"49958d16-42d3-11f1-9bc9-fcc3db027440,38650,28-04-2026 00:00,L7,L7A,MKPRD,NULL,O&amp;M,IT,Procurement of IT Asset,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,28-04-2026 12:47,373,""Sub: Requirement of printer for E&amp;M custody store/Line-7 at Mukundpur Depot."															
"With reference to the above subject, this is to bring to your kind notice that the E&amp;M Custody Store at Mukundpur Depot is the central store for Line-7 &amp; Line-8 Extn., handling critical tasks such as planning of stock items, EAC review, processing new cases for non-stock items, technical scrutiny of stock &amp; non stock items and making reservations for stock items. These tasks require frequent printing of documents and the unavailability of a printer is hampering the pace of work. At present, there is no printer available for E&amp;M department custody store at Mukundpur depot. "															
"In view of the above, there is an urgent need for a printer to ensure the smooth functioning of day-to-day activities. It is requested that a printer be issued to the E&amp;M Custody Store, Line-7 at Mukundpur Depot."															
"Put up for your kind approval please."",2,Hardware,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,,3,NULL,989,NULL,NULL,1,0,20893,SANDEEP KUMAR SINGH,7011346032,170228,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,20893,28-04-2026 12:47,18-05-2026 10:53,989,10.10.28.1,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,,Request pertains to O&amp;M Department.,0,1"															
