4-	Enter App name (like IMAP) then generate Password 12 digit and note down it.														
Go to mobile IMAP configuration and enter the below details:															
5-	Incoming mail Server :- imap.mgovcloud.in														
Port: - 993 Require SSL: - Yes 															
6-	Outgoing/SMTP mail Server :- smtp.mgovcloud.in														
"       Port: - 465 (with SSL) Require Authentication: - Yes"",0,1"															
